{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2022\u00a0<strong>Maroxyn Drarea\u00a0\u2022</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A first-person horror game set in a lightless, desolate realm. With no weapons, no companions, and no help, your only tools are three spells - each used at a cost. In a hostile environment that aims to keep you forever, with fog and darkness covering every direction, your escape lies within light.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2022 <strong>The Sigils\u00a0</strong>\u2022</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Six sigils of light exist somewhere in the gloom; scattered and hidden - find and activate them all and you may escape.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/extras/55c5c24f84e64b312c30f04079f25ade.poster.avif?t=1753793341\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/extras/55c5c24f84e64b312c30f04079f25ade.webm?t=1753793341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/extras/55c5c24f84e64b312c30f04079f25ade.mp4?t=1753793341\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u2022 Hurt and Disorientation are guaranteed if you are not careful \u2022</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every step forward drains you. Every spell you use - descry, lucent, ward - takes something from you. One casts light. One reveals truth. One guards you for a moment longer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u2022 Lucent \u2022</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\u00a0<strong>Use Lucent to cast a light that helps you navigate and see farther than the darkness allows. The key to escape and the anchor to permanence.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/extras/42f26c39edf244c024d1ecabb38a6de4.poster.avif?t=1753793341\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/extras/42f26c39edf244c024d1ecabb38a6de4.webm?t=1753793341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/extras/42f26c39edf244c024d1ecabb38a6de4.mp4?t=1753793341\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2022 <strong>Descry\u00a0</strong>\u2022</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\u00a0<strong>Use Descry to reveal the truth, find the sigils, and navigate your way to them. Sacrifices are made and the roots grow stronger.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/extras/f60dafcc44067f20502f1034278cbd21.poster.avif?t=1753793341\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/extras/f60dafcc44067f20502f1034278cbd21.webm?t=1753793341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/extras/f60dafcc44067f20502f1034278cbd21.mp4?t=1753793341\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/extras/637f63c84a9097aa4daa80b54156f9dd.poster.avif?t=1753793341\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_