graph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every step forward drains you. Every spell you use - descry, lucent, ward - takes something from you. One casts light. One reveals truth. One guards you for a moment longer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u2022 Lucent \u2022</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\u00a0<strong>Use Lucent to cast a light that helps you navigate and see farther than the darkness allows. The key to escape and the anchor to permanence.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/extras/42f26c39edf244c024d1ecabb38a6de4.poster.avif?t=1753793341\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/extras/42f26c39edf244c024d1ecabb38a6de4.webm?t=1753793341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/extras/42f26c39edf244c024d1ecabb38a6de4.mp4?t=1753793341\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2022 <strong>Descry\u00a0</strong>\u2022</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\u00a0<strong>Use Descry to reveal the truth, find the sigils, and navigate your way to them. Sacrifices are made and the roots grow stronger.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/extras/f60dafcc44067f20502f1034278cbd21.poster.avif?t=1753793341\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/extras/f60dafcc44067f20502f1034278cbd21.webm?t=1753793341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/